<!-- ============================================================ HEADER ============================================================ -->
<header class="report-header">
  <div class="header-label">UNODC Crime Trends Survey &nbsp;|&nbsp; Policy Analysis Report</div>
  <h1 class="header-title">Global Intentional Homicide Trends:<br>A Multi-Dimensional Analysis (1990–2023)</h1>
  <p class="header-subtitle">A comprehensive examination of how homicide rates have evolved across nations, regions, sexes, and age groups over three decades — providing evidence-based insights for policy action.</p>
  <div class="header-meta">
    <span>📅 Published: April 2026</span>
    <span>📊 Data Source: UNODC Crime Trends Survey</span>
    <span>🌍 201 Countries &amp; Territories</span>
